#N canvas 20 20 2400 1500 12;
#X text 20 20 e_freeverb -- the reverb's freeverb \, one of e_verb's three engines (Brendan \, 2026-11-05): Jezar's public-domain Freeverb in vanilla boxes \, its left side \, mono: eight combs \, each damped by a one-pole low-pass in its feedback \, summed into four allpasses in series \, at the standard tunings. ref/module/sequencer.md, f 70;
#X text 20 150 creation arg 1: c_kit's \$0 \, for the throw. arg 2: e_verb's \$0 \, for its input. In: the sends \, on e_verb's \$2-in. inlet: want <1 or 0> \, size <0-100> and damping <0-100> \, from e_verb. Out: the reverb alone \, thrown to c_kit's \$1-out. outlet: 1 or 0 as its switch~ turns., f 70;
